      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "While it may look quite appealing in a movie; the real life is strikingly different. Governance in a democracy is all about taking everyone along with you. Moreover, in a large and diverse country like India, it is not possible to take decision on the whims of an individual. Implementation of a decision needs to coordination among various organs of the government and a minister is just a part of that system.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
    "final_answer": "Therefore, governance requires collaboration and cannot be based on individual whims.",
